ree  broiler and get a nice char on it it  comes with grilled asparagus topped with  bernays the steak's topped with truffle  butter it comes with a red wine demi and  just if that isn't enough we went ahead  and did butter poached lobster mashed  potatoes oh my gosh you had me at  truffle butter but now i'm looking at  these mashed potatoes and they look  amazing  if this is just a preview of what's on  the menu i can only imagine when it's  like actually in the restaurant and hey  if bourbon isn't your thing you guys  also have a wine list too right  absolutely and the uh  with along with everything else we've  improved the the beverage program and  our wines  mostly california reds  and the selections are  are just amazing well you can't go wrong  can i have a red in one hand and a  bourbon in the other and it's going to  be a fun night and just how does it feel  to reopen after all this time of being  closed i'm sure it's going to be a  really special moment tomorrow i think i  think tomorrow is the uh you know sort  of the pinnacle for us we've done all  the background work and we've we trained  the staff and we've done these trial  feedings and and really raise the  expectations and tomorrow just to be  able to open those doors share it with  the public and be able to just you know  start the new journey is really  invigorating and really exciting and i  mean we couldn't be happier  this is the one restaurant that we've  been waiting and waiting and waiting  to to be able to unveil again and um so  we're we're all super super excited i  think we're all on cloud nine we're kind  of running on adrenaline a little bit  maybe a little bit  but we're gonna make it yes well  congrats on the reopening i feel like  you guys should grab a glass and do  little cheers to the camera because this  is an exciting moment so be sure to go  to twins creek steakhouse at the  silverton i can vouch that it's  delicious thank you guys for being here
 

